Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:43.62,ED_CN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(220,220)\fax-0.1\blur3}在光照不到的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:52.10,ED_CN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(220,220)\fax-0.1\blur3}我獨自尋覓著甚麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.84,0:20:59.93,ED_CN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(220,220)\fax-0.1\blur3}持杖所需的那份堅強
